#. 十神クン、こんなところで
#. 何をやってるの？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What are you doing here, Byakuya?"
msgstr ""

#. …見ればわかるだろう、読書だ。
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Isn't it obvious? I'm reading."
msgstr ""

#. ここなら邪魔が入らないと思ったんだがな。
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I was *hoping* I wouldn't be bothered in a place like\n"
"this..."
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、それより…
#. ここ、元通りになったんだね…
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, it looks like everything's been returned to\n"
"normal here."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>カーペットのシミも消えてるし、
#. ポスターもグラビアアイドルのものになってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The coffee stains on the carpet are gone, and the\n"
"bikini model poster is back...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんたちの時と同じ…
#. モノクマがやったんだろうな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's just like with Sayaka. Monokuma must have done\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. こんな物を気にしてもしょうがない、
#. 放っておこう。
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I can't let it get to me. I need to just forget about\n"
"it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. きっと今も、この向こうで…黒幕が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even now, the mastermind is probably on the other side\n"
"of that surveillance camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう思うとムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just thinking about it puts me on edge...but there's\n"
"nothing I can really do about it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>カーペットのシミも消えてるし、
#. ポスターもグラビアアイドルのものになってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The coffee stains on the carpet are gone, and the\n"
"bikini model poster is back...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんたちの時と同じ…
#. モノクマがやったんだろうな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's just like with Sayaka. Monokuma must have done\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>男子更衣室から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the boys locker room?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
